{
  "info": {
    "name": "Smart Ranking - Auth Module",
    "description": "Collection para UAT do Auth Module (api-gateway).\n\n## Fluxo sugerido de teste\n1. Register\n2. Login (salva accessToken automaticamente + cookie refreshToken)\n3. Me (usa accessToken)\n4. Refresh (usa cookie)\n5. Change Password\n6. Logout (limpa cookie)\n7. Forgot Password\n8. Reset Password (precisa do token do e-mail/DB)\n\n## Nota sobre cookies\nO cookie `refreshToken` tem flag `secure: true`. Para testes locais via HTTP, ajuste temporariamente para `secure: false` no controller, ou use HTTPS local. O Postman gerencia cookies automaticamente via cookie jar.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{accessToken}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. Register",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"{{userName}}\",\n  \"email\": \"{{userEmail}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{userPassword}}\",\n  \"phoneNumber\": \"{{userPhone}}\"\n}"
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/register",
          "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
          "path": ["auth", "register"]
        },
        "description": "Cria novo usuário (role PLAYER por padrão).\n\nValidações:\n- name: min 2 chars\n- email: formato válido\n- password: min 8 chars\n- phoneNumber: formato BR\n\nRetorna: { user: { id, name, email, role } }"
      },
      "response": [],
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('Status 201 Created', function () {",
              "    pm.response.to.have.status(201);",
              "});",
              "",
              "pm.test('Response has user object', function () {",
              "    const json = pm.response.json();",
              "    pm.expect(json.user).to.have.property('id');",
              "    pm.expect(json.user).to.have.property('name');",
              "    pm.expect(json.user).to.have.property('email');",
              "    pm.expect(json.user).to.have.property('role');",
              "    pm.expect(json.user.role).to.eql('PLAYER');",
              "});",
              "",
              "pm.test('No sensitive fields leaked', function () {",
              "    const json = pm.response.json();",
              "    pm.expect(json.user).to.not.have.property('password');",
              "    pm.expect(json.user).to.not.have.property('passwordResetToken');",
              "    pm.expect(json.user).to.not.have.property('failedLoginAttempts');",
              "});"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "2. Login",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{userEmail}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{userPassword}}\"\n}"
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login",
          "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
          "path": ["auth", "login"]
        },
        "auth": {
          "type": "noauth"
        },
        "description": "Autentica usuário.\n\nRetorna: { accessToken, user: { id, name, email, role } }\nCookie: refreshToken (HttpOnly, Secure, SameSite=Strict, Path=/api/v1/auth, 7d)"
      },
      "response": [],
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('Status 200 OK', function () {",
              "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
              "});",
              "",
              "pm.test('Response has accessToken', function () {",
              "    const json = pm.response.json();",
              "    pm.expect(json).to.have.property('accessToken');",
              "    pm.expect(json.accessToken).to.be.a('string').and.not.empty;",
              "});",
              "",
              "pm.test('Response has user object', function () {",
              "    const json = pm.response.json();",
              "    pm.expect(json.user).to.have.property('id');",
              "    pm.expect(json.user).to.have.property('email');",
              "    pm.expect(json.user).to.have.property('role');",
              "});",
              "",
              "// Auto-save accessToken to environment",
              "const json = pm.response.json();",
              "if (json.accessToken) {",
              "    pm.environment.set('accessToken', json.accessToken);",
              "    console.log('accessToken saved to environment');",
              "}"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "3. Me",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/me",
          "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
          "path": ["auth", "me"]
        },
        "description": "Retorna dados do usuário autenticado.\nRequer: Bearer token (Authorization header).\n\nRetorna: { id, name, email, phoneNumber, role, createdAt }"
      },
      "response": [],
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('Status 200 OK', function () {",
              "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
              "});",
              "",
              "pm.test('Response has user profile fields', function () {",
              "    const json = pm.response.json();",
              "    pm.expect(json).to.have.property('id');",
              "    pm.expect(json).to.have.property('name');",
              "    pm.expect(json).to.have.property('email');",
              "    pm.expect(json).to.have.property('phoneNumber');",
              "    pm.expect(json).to.have.property('role');",
              "    pm.expect(json).to.have.property('createdAt');",
              "});",
              "",
              "pm.test('No sensitive fields leaked', function () {",
              "    const json = pm.response.json();",
              "    pm.expect(json).to.not.have.property('password');",
              "    pm.expect(json).to.not.have.property('isActive');",
              "    pm.expect(json).to.not.have.property('failedLoginAttempts');",
              "});"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "4. Refresh Token",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/refresh",
          "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
          "path": ["auth", "refresh"]
        },
        "auth": {
          "type": "noauth"
        },
        "description": "Renova accessToken usando o cookie refreshToken.\nNao requer Authorization header.\n\nCookie refreshToken enviado automaticamente pelo Postman (cookie jar).\n\nRetorna: { accessToken }\nAtualiza o cookie refreshToken (rotation).\n\nSe nao houver cookie, retorna { accessToken: '' } (graceful degradation)."
      },
      "response": [],
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('Status 200 OK', function () {",
              "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
              "});",
              "",
              "pm.test('Response has accessToken', function () {",
              "    const json = pm.response.json();",
              "    pm.expect(json).to.have.property('accessToken');",
              "});",
              "",
              "// Auto-save new accessToken if not empty",
              "const json = pm.response.json();",
              "if (json.accessToken) {",
              "    pm.environment.set('accessToken', json.accessToken);",
              "    console.log('accessToken refreshed and saved');",
              "}"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "5. Change Password",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"currentPassword\": \"{{userPassword}}\",\n  \"newPassword\": \"N3wStr0ng@Pass!\"\n}"
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/change-password",
          "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
          "path": ["auth", "change-password"]
        },
        "description": "Altera senha do usuário autenticado.\nRequer: Bearer token.\n\nValidações:\n- currentPassword: obrigatório\n- newPassword: min 8 chars, diferente da atual\n\nRetorna: { message: 'Password changed successfully' }\nRevoga todos os refresh tokens (força re-login em outros devices)."
      },
      "response": [],
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('Status 200 OK', function () {",
              "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
              "});",
              "",
              "pm.test('Response has success message', function () {",
              "    const json = pm.response.json();",
              "    pm.expect(json.message).to.eql('Password changed successfully');",
              "});"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "6. Logout",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/logout",
          "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
          "path": ["auth", "logout"]
        },
        "description": "Desloga o usuário.\nRequer: Bearer token.\n\nRevoga o refresh token no DB e limpa o cookie.\nSe nao houver cookie, apenas limpa (graceful).\n\nRetorna: { message: 'Logged out successfully' }"
      },
      "response": [],
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('Status 200 OK', function () {",
              "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
              "});",
              "",
              "pm.test('Response has success message', function () {",
              "    const json = pm.response.json();",
              "    pm.expect(json.message).to.eql('Logged out successfully');",
              "});",
              "",
              "// Clear accessToken from environment after logout",
              "pm.environment.set('accessToken', '');"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "7. Forgot Password",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{userEmail}}\"\n}"
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/forgot-password",
          "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
          "path": ["auth", "forgot-password"]
        },
        "auth": {
          "type": "noauth"
        },
        "description": "Solicita reset de senha.\nSempre retorna 200 mesmo que o e-mail nao exista (RN-047: previne enumeracao).\n\nRetorna: { message: 'If this email exists, a reset link has been sent' }\n\nPara testar o reset-password, busque o token no MongoDB:\ndb.users.findOne({ email: '...' }, { passwordResetToken: 1 })\n\nNota: o token armazenado no DB é o SHA-256 hash. O token raw foi enviado por e-mail (LocalStack SES)."
      },
      "response": [],
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('Status 200 OK', function () {",
              "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
              "});",
              "",
              "pm.test('Response has generic message (no enumeration)', function () {",
              "    const json = pm.response.json();",
              "    pm.expect(json.message).to.eql('If this email exists, a reset link has been sent');",
              "});"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "8. Reset Password",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"token\": \"{{resetToken}}\",\n  \"newPassword\": \"R3set@NewPass!\"\n}"
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/reset-password",
          "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
          "path": ["auth", "reset-password"]
        },
        "auth": {
          "type": "noauth"
        },
        "description": "Reseta a senha usando o token recebido por e-mail.\n\nO token raw deve ser o que foi enviado por e-mail (nao o hash do DB).\nO use case faz SHA-256 do token para buscar no DB.\n\nValidações:\n- token: obrigatório\n- newPassword: min 8 chars\n\nRetorna: { message: 'Password reset successfully' }\nRevoga todos os refresh tokens."
      },
      "response": [],
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('Status 200 OK', function () {",
              "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
              "});",
              "",
              "pm.test('Response has success message', function () {",
              "    const json = pm.response.json();",
              "    pm.expect(json.message).to.eql('Password reset successfully');",
              "});"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "--- Error Cases ---",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Register - Email duplicado",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"{{userName}}\",\n  \"email\": \"{{userEmail}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{userPassword}}\",\n  \"phoneNumber\": \"{{userPhone}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/register",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "register"]
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "description": "Tenta registrar com e-mail que ja existe. Deve retornar 409 Conflict."
          },
          "response": [],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 409 Conflict', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(409);",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Login - Senha errada",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{userEmail}}\",\n  \"password\": \"WrongPassword123\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "login"]
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "description": "Login com senha incorreta. Deve retornar 401 Unauthorized."
          },
          "response": [],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 401 Unauthorized', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(401);",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Me - Sem token",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/me",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "me"]
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "description": "Acessa /me sem Authorization header. Deve retornar 401."
          },
          "response": [],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 401 Unauthorized', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(401);",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Register - Validacao (body vazio)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/register",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "register"]
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "description": "Envia body vazio no register. Deve retornar 400 com erros de validacao."
          },
          "response": [],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 400 Bad Request', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(400);",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
